---
const questions = [
  'Which agent is working on what?',
  'Which one is stuck, waiting for an answer?',
  'What did the agents actually do this week?',
];
---

<section class="section" id="why">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Why Orrery</span>
      <h2>Your tracker was built for people. Your work isn’t only done by people anymore.</h2>
      <p>
        Claude Code, Codex and Cursor now do real work on each team member’s machine. That work
        happens outside the tracker, so nobody can answer the simple questions.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ol class="questions">
      {questions.map((q, i) => (
        <li>
          <span class="n">0{i + 1}</span>
          <span>{q}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <blockquote>
      <p>
        An <strong>orrery</strong> is a model of the solar system that shows every planet on its own
        orbit, moving in one system. Here the planets are your issues, your people and your agents.
      </p>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 80px);
    align-items: end;
  }

  .section-head {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .questions {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .questions li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding-block: 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.4vw, 1.75rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .questions li:first-child {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .n {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--accent-text);
  }

  blockquote {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: clamp(48px, 7vw, 80px) 0 0;
    padding-left: 22px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  blockquote strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
